      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "button 0 (orange, right of USB):\n  single press → Normal ↔ Quiet\n  double press → Max ↔ Normal\n  long press (1 s) → Normal",
      "originalText": "button 0 (orange, right of USB):\n  single press → Normal ↔ Quiet\n  double press → Max ↔ Normal\n  long press (1 s) → Normal",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e96",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -140,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 247.50000000000003,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 59994415,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 600046750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LED 47 shows the profile:\n  green  Normal\n  blue   Quiet\n  red    Max\n  amber  switch off",
      "originalText": "LED 47 shows the profile:\n  green  Normal\n  blue   Quiet\n  red    Max\n  amber  switch off",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e97",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 524.7,
      "height": 337.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1014127815,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 556572714,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Three wires from the switch's cable:\n\n  D  →  pin 21\n        right block, inner column, 5th hole down\n        (between 34 and 17)\n  +  →  3V3 rail   (not 5 V)\n  −  →  GND        (either GND hole, or the GND rail)\n\nSwitch pressed in (lit)  =  fans ON\nSwitch out               =  fans OFF\n\nOff wins over every profile, except that a\nfan whose probe reaches 55 °C still runs.\nAfter a power cut the board follows\nwhatever position the switch is in.",
      "originalText": "Three wires from the switch's cable:\n\n  D  →  pin 21\n        right block, inner column, 5th hole down\n        (between 34 and 17)\n  +  →  3V3 rail   (not 5 V)\n  −  →  GND        (either GND hole, or the GND rail)\n\nSwitch pressed in (lit)  =  fans ON\nSwitch out               =  fans OFF\n\nOff wins over every profile, except that a\nfan whose probe reaches 55 °C still runs.\nAfter a power cut the board follows\nwhatever position the switch is in.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
